    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#1e88e5;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">2</span><strong style="color:#e3f2fd;">Step 2: Access</strong>
    </p>
