    <div style="background:#0d1b2e;border:1px solid #1e88e5;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:10px;"><strong style="color:#bbdefb;">✅ Model answer:</strong> Awareness campaigns, scheduled class visits and diverse alumni talks.</div>
