    <p>Use support systems effectively by knowing your need, choosing the right place, preparing, being honest and polite, acting on advice and following up. Challenges include stigma, privacy worries, too few staff, lack of time, wrong information and over-dependence. Solutions include awareness talks, confidentiality rules, peer counsellors and alumni, scheduled sessions and reliable sources.</p>
